# UI / Arabic

- Arabic-first.
- RTL from the first implementation.
- Portrait-only.
- Responsive tablet support.
- No business rules in widgets.
- Riverpod orchestrates state; Game Engine decides legality.
- Drag/drop feedback must clearly show valid/rejected result.
- Do not rely only on color.
- Support readable Arabic typography and text scaling.
- Story moments are skippable immediately.
